{"id":"n63500-5-6","stage":1,"title":"늙다 · 显老","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63500-5-6-1","ko":"저 친구가 자네보다 다섯 살이나 어리네.","zh":"那个朋友比你小五岁呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"자네보다","meaning":"你","explanation":"자네：你；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자네보다","audio":"/audio/56af0ab5d48f48af4b62.mp3"}},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}},{"text":"살이나","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이나","audio":"/audio/a2e1dcdb6d707ddf9419.mp3"}},{"text":"어리네.","meaning":"年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年龄小；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"2","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어리네","audio":"/audio/26f98123e6bb64544fe2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"(敬语)听者为朋友或晚辈时用来指称听者。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"0d616c5afd4feb13","term":"다섯","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3","entryId":"58111","definition":"四加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["다섣"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小于比较对象。","pronunciation":["어리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aa8a6f601afc52826229.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63500-5-6-2","ko":"정말요? 아니 뭘 하다가 저렇게 늙었대요?","zh":"真的吗？他平时都做些什么，会变得这么老啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말요?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말요","audio":"/audio/590ccbea0714dba09143.mp3"}},{"text":"아니","meaning":"啊，唷，呀","explanation":"아니：啊，唷，呀","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"2","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3